<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`第十三章安全和 JWT。登录状态检查怎么做，三步。

第一步，实现 AuthHandler 并注册为 bean。看右边这段代码：类上加 @Bean，实现 check 方法，参数是 AuthParam，返回 AuthStatus。

逻辑是：如果这个接口标了忽略鉴权，就直接 OK；否则调 UserSessionCache 点 verify，通过了也是 OK；不通过就返回 InvalidSession，带 401 状态码和一段 JSON 响应体。

AuthParam 提供了五样东西：ctx 是当前 HttpContext；path 是「controller 定义的映射路径」，注意不是请求路径，所以路径参数是不展开的；args 是参数；还有 ignoreAuth 和 ignorePrivilege 两个标志。

AuthStatus 是一个枚举，六个值决定 MVC 怎么响应：OK 是通过；SessionNotFound 是没找到登录状态，也就是未登录或者已过期；InvalidSession 是找到了但本次传入的登录信息无效；SessionError 是检查登录状态时出错；PrivilegeError 是检查权限时出错；NoPrivilege 是没有权限。

注意后五个都带状态码和响应体两个参数。不带 HttpStatus 的构造器表示状态码 200；带的话就用你指定的状态码。响应体那个 Any 实际支持五种类型。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 13 章 · 安全 f_security + f_jwt · 13.1</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>登录状态检查怎么做</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>三步</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', marginBottom: 8 }}>第一步 · 实现 AuthHandler 并注册为 bean</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>@Bean</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"public class AuthCheckerImpl <: AuthHandler {"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    public func check(param: AuthParam): AuthStatus {"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        if (param.ignoreAuth) { OK }"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        else if (UserSessionCache.verify()) { OK }"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        else {"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'            let json = \'{ "status":-1 }\''}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"            InvalidSession(HttpStatus.UNAUTHORIZED, JsonValue.fromStr(json))"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        }"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    }"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 'auto' }}>AuthParam 提供：ctx（当前 HttpContext）、path（controller 定义的映射路径，不是请求路径）、args、ignoreAuth、ignorePrivilege。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 460, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>AuthStatus 六个值</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10 }}>OK　通过</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 4 }}>SessionNotFound(status, any)　没找到登录状态（未登录 / 已过期）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 4 }}>InvalidSession(status, any)　找到了但本次传入的登录信息无效</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 4 }}>SessionError(status, any)　检查登录状态时出错</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 4 }}>PrivilegeError(status, any)　检查权限时出错</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 4 }}>NoPrivilege(status, any)　没有权限</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ height: 168, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>两个细节</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 8 }}>不带 HttpStatus 的构造器表示状态码 200；带的话用你指定的状态码。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 8 }}>Any 实际支持 String / ToString / InputStream / 字节数组 / f_data.ToData。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>fountain · 一站式服务器应用开发工具库</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>87 / 116</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
